{"id": "EUVD-2026-71412", "enisaUuid": "95eff8aa-ba7b-349c-8e18-a26c0fb91b1a", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nHID: rapoo: fix missing hid_is_usb() check\n\nto_usb_interface() can only be used on a hid_device whose parent is really\nUSB; uhid can create devices that identify as being on BUS_USB, but don't\nactually have a USB parent.\nFix the use of to_usb_interface() without a hid_is_usb() check.\n\nAdd a dependency on USB_HID for hid_is_usb(), as other HID drivers do; the\nalternative would be to provide a simple stub implementation on !USB_HID\nbuilds.\n\nI have verified that it is currently possible to trigger a kernel splat due\nto this bug in an ASAN build, and that this commit fixes the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T15:12:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:43:25", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/99ed3febafe0452994620a4d819f595583289bec", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49b6fd28fbcc0b6457e16e25c7617f63449d4808", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b57af2448268c30c25509a832b6ff6dc27176b28"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-80769", "GHSA-cqwg-p2fx-632h"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0c6ac2cf-da96-3b4b-a73f-149cd05110a6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "1e5523b6-9ee8-32d0-a457-1b8542736b6b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.1"}, {"id": "38e84d01-b3f6-363d-843b-3373bb2d61c1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b3b1c68fb726907ea35ac172906705fe62c7fdaf <99ed3febafe0452994620a4d819f595583289bec"}, {"id": "425fd250-cb00-3f8a-97b2-91b698f9252d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.11"}, {"id": "52bba918-ebd8-3e01-8d19-1ea118a552d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b3b1c68fb726907ea35ac172906705fe62c7fdaf <b57af2448268c30c25509a832b6ff6dc27176b28"}, {"id": "6c1eb788-7af4-32be-bbff-0e0a76f5c1c5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b3b1c68fb726907ea35ac172906705fe62c7fdaf <49b6fd28fbcc0b6457e16e25c7617f63449d4808"}, {"id": "96703dcd-11e9-30ff-bd68-b1fc209a798b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "968616d9-a5ec-36b1-ac25-7c93d3189d15", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "17897e42-895a-3ef0-b0c9-09e9f6c4aaf0", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}